            "review_title": "Review at Cuisine de Vin",
            "review_text": "Maps35901941042\n2 contributions\n0\nA warm and cozy atmosphere\nJul 2025 • Couples\nIf you are seeking a cozy and romantic setting for meaningful conversations, this place is an excellent choice.\nThe food is satisfactory, and the staff are attentive, friendly, and eager to assist.\nPricing is reasonable and aligns well with the quality of the dishes.\nTable decoration services are also available upon request.\nI would be pleased to return should the opportunity arise ✨\nWritten July 14, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
