            "review_title": "Review at Cuisine de Vin",
            "review_text": "Pedro V\nZaandam, The Netherlands611 contributions\n1\nNever go here!!\nApr 2019 • Couples\nThis restaurant has ridiculous high prices. And they lie about it on internet! They advertise on internet with a \"glass of Vin Wine\" for 50.000 VND, but when you are in the restaurant the cheap wine is \"finished\" and the cheapest wine is 450.000 VND!! 20 US$ for a glass of wine!! The cheapest beer is 380.000 VND!! Thats 16 us$!! Also the prices on the menu were MUCH higher than on internet. We said it to the waiter, and she said: O, yes, the owner did forget to write the new changed prices on the internet... Do yourself a favour, and DON'T GO TO THIS \"RESTAURANT\"!!!\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 26, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
